  "answer_text": "You can access the login portals for **PreLicenseTraining.com (PLT)** using the links and instructions below:\n\n### 1. Student Account Login\nIf you are an insurance student taking pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses:\n* **Login Link:** Go to the [PreLicenseTraining.com Student Login Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com) and click **Login** in the top navigation bar.\n* **Credentials:** Enter your **Email/Login Name** and **Password**. *(Note: Your login name defaults to the email address you signed up with unless you changed it inside your account dashboard.)*\n\n### 2. Mentor / Recruiter Login\nIf you are a manager, recruiter, or coach tracking student progress:\n* **Login Link:** Access the [PLT Mentor Portal](https://www.prelicensetraining.com) by clicking **Mentor Login** at the bottom of the page or in the main menu.\n* **Credentials:** Enter your registered **Email** and **Password**.\n\n---\n\n### Need Help Accessing Your Account?\nIf you are having trouble logging in, use the self-service recovery links on the main login screen:\n* **Forgot Password:** If you cannot remember your password, click the **Forgot Password** link. You will need to enter your registered email address to receive password reset instructions.\n* **Forgot Login/Email:** If you are unsure which email or login name you used, click **Forgot Login**. You can recover your login name by entering either your password combined with your email, or your first name, last name, and password. \n\n*For further assistance, you can contact PreLicenseTraining.com customer service directly at **1 (800) 780-2113**.*",
